<title>USA: Perceptron Inc Q3 net up.</title>
<headline>Perceptron Inc Q3 net up.</headline>
<dateline>FARMINGTON HILLS, Mich. 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.36		    $0.34</p>
<p> Net			  2,789		    2,516</p>
<p> Revs			12,856		    9,311</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,680		    7,310</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.80		    $0.72</p>
<p> Net			  6,084		    5,163</p>
<p> Revs			33,581		   23,903</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   7,600		    7,187</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q3 shr and 9-mos shr would have been $0.24 and $0.50, respectively, had income been taxed at 1996 rate of 30 percent.</p>
<p>--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
